#: ../../talk/index.rst:3
msgid "Talk"
msgstr "Talk"

#: ../../talk/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"Nextcloud Talk offers audio/video and text chat integrated in Nextcloud. It "
"is available as a web interface, desktop client, and mobile apps for Android"
" and iOS."
msgstr ""
"Nextcloud Talk giver lyd-, video- og tekstchat direkte i Nextcloud. Talk "
"findes i browseren, som skrivebordsprogram og som mobilapp til Android og "
"iOS."

#: ../../talk/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can find out more about Nextcloud Talk `on our website "
"<https://nextcloud.com/talk/>`_. Download the desktop and mobile clients "
"from `nextcloud.com/install <https://nextcloud.com/install/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Du kan læse mere om Nextcloud Talk `på vores websted "
"<https://nextcloud.com/talk/>`_. Hent skrivebordsprogrammet og mobilapperne "
"fra `nextcloud.com/install <https://nextcloud.com/install/>`_."

#: ../../talk/index.rst:11
msgid "Talk call in grid view showing multiple participants"
msgstr "Opkald i Talk i gittervisning med flere deltagere"
